2, "text": "Cause mess is life, let\u2019s make it clear!"}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "So, leave me in my joyful, silly mess,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Cause mess is life, it's not that complex!"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "We don\u2019t care about tidying, just having fun,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "And enjoying every moment, until the day is done!"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}